      <VERS vnumber="29">And he <gr str="6680">charged </gr>them, and <gr str="559">said </gr>to them, I am to be <gr str="622">gathered </gr>to my <gr str="5971">people</gr>: <gr str="6912">bury </gr>me with my <gr str="1">fathers </gr>in the <gr str="4631">cave </gr>that <STYLE css="font-style:italic">is</STYLE> in the <gr str="7704">field </gr>of <gr str="6085">Ephron </gr>the <gr str="2850">Hittite</gr>,</VERS>
